    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 730 of the laws of 2019, amending the executive law\nrelating to the authority of the New York black car operators' injury\ncompensation fund, inc., in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7193",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7193-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
